.TH ag-git-export-issues 1  "export-issues 0.3.0-beta.7"
.SH NAME
ag\-git\-export\-issues \- Export GitHub/GitLab issues and comments to a normalized import manifest
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBag git export\-issues\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-as\fR] [\fB\-\-host\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fB\-\-provider\fR> <\fB\-\-source\fR> <\fB\-\-output\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export GitHub/GitLab issues and comments to a normalized import manifest
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Operate on the repository at this path (default: discovered from the current directory)
.TP
\fB\-\-provider\fR \fI<PROVIDER>\fR
Source hosting provider
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
github
.IP \(bu 2
gitlab
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-as\fR \fI<IDENTITY>\fR
Act as this identity (`user:alice`, `agent:bot#run_…`, `service:ci`). Also: AG_IDENTITY
.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<SOURCE>\fR
Repository path, for example owner/repo or group/subgroup/repo
.TP
\fB\-\-host\fR \fI<HOST>\fR
GitLab HTTPS origin, for example https://gitlab.example.com
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON output
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR
Colour the output: auto (a terminal, unless NO_COLOR is set), always or never
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
New manifest file. An existing file is never replaced
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print only what was asked for: no confirmations or hints. Errors and refusals are still shown
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Explain what is happening on standard error: repository, identity, remote, timing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH VERSION
v0.3.0\-beta.7
